{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53623","headline":"灙谷 · 崔觐","name":"灙谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高峰偃蹇云崔嵬，层崖巨壑长峡开。\n龙蛇纵横虎豹乱，古（《洋县志》作「石」）栈朽灭埋深苔。\n（见宋祝穆《方舆胜览》卷六六，校以光绪二十八年张鹏翼纂《洋县志》卷七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔觐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}